WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.128
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind pictures and sounds.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.963
Text: communicates information with words. Image: communicates using pictures.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:16.849
Audio: communicates using sound. Video: shows moving images, usually with sound.

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:19.613
Caption: adds an explanation to media.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.540
Make a one-page paper example about your school or a Ghanaian festival. Include text,

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.813
image and audio; present it clearly to a partner.
